#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:3
msgid "Implementing a New Function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:5
msgid ""
"This guide provides a step-by-step walkthrough for adding a new function to "
"LLVM-libc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:9
msgid ""
"Adding a new function involves several steps, from updating the public "
"specification to implementing and testing the code. Below is the standard "
"checklist for contributors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:11
msgid "Step-by-Step Checklist"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:13
msgid "1. Header Entry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:15
msgid ""
"Update the standard YAML file that describes the public header to ensure the "
"function is included in the generated public header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:17
msgid ""
"**File**: `libc/include/<header>.yaml` (or `libc/include/sys/<header>.yaml` "
"for system headers)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:18
msgid "Add the new function to the `functions` list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:19
msgid "Specify its name, return type, and arguments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:20
msgid "List the standards it complies with (e.g., `stdc`, `POSIX`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:22
msgid "2. Header Declaration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:24
msgid ""
"Declare the function in the internal implementation header file. This file "
"is used by other internal code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:26
msgid "**File**: `libc/src/<header>/<func>.h`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:27
msgid "Follow the structure defined in {ref}`implementation_standard`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:28
msgid "Ensure the declaration is inside the `LIBC_NAMESPACE_DECL` namespace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:30
msgid "3. Implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:32
msgid "Write the actual code for the function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:34
msgid ""
"**File**: `libc/src/<header>/<func>.cpp` (or `libc/src/<header>/<os>/"
"<func>.cpp` for platform-specific implementations)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:35
msgid "Use the `LLVM_LIBC_FUNCTION` macro."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:36
msgid "Refer to {ref}`code_style` for naming and layout conventions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:38
msgid "4. CMake Rule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:40
msgid "Add a CMake target for the new function so it can be compiled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:42
msgid "**File**: `libc/src/<header>/CMakeLists.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:43
msgid "Add an `add_entrypoint_object` rule for the new file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:44
msgid ""
"List all internal dependencies correctly to ensure proper build order. If "
"the function reads or sets `errno`, include both "
"`libc.src.__support.libc_errno` and `libc.src.errno.errno` in `DEPENDS` (see "
"{ref}`setting_errno`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:48
msgid "5. Platform Registration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:50
msgid ""
"Register the new entrypoint for the target platforms to include it in the "
"build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:52
msgid "**File**: `libc/config/<os>/<arch>/entrypoints.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:53
msgid "Add the new function to the list of active entrypoints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:55
msgid "6. Testing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:57
msgid "Create tests to verify the implementation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:59
msgid "**File**: `libc/test/src/<header>/<func>_test.cpp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:60
msgid ""
"Add corresponding tests using the internal testing framework. For functions "
"setting `errno`, use `ErrnoCheckingTest` and `ErrnoSetterMatcher` (see {ref}"
"`setting_errno`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/implementing_a_function.md:63
msgid ""
"Update the `CMakeLists.txt` in the test directory (`libc/test/src/<header>/"
"CMakeLists.txt`) to include the new test target."
msgstr ""
